WEBVTT

00:00:02.620 --> 00:00:04.620
Siblings?

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:09.790
If I had been born her real brother,

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:09.790
I would have been much happier...

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:11.450
What do you mean?

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:14.660
Yuki is without a doubt

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:16.500
a Pureblood daughter

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:16.500
of the Kuran family.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:21.790
Even a washout vampire like you,

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:21.790
should be able to tell.

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:27.200
But you're on the side of those

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:27.200
who hunt us down as well, aren't you?

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:29.160
What will you do now?

00:02:12.950 --> 00:02:17.200
SPIRALING RECOLLECTIONS

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:21.120
<i>Isn't Brother coming yet?</i>

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:24.290
He should be coming home soon.

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:28.790
Yuki, you really love

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:28.790
your brother, don't you?

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:30.080
Uh-huh...

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:31.580
Oh!

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:35.700
Welcome home, Brother Kaname!

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:39.040
Nice to be back, Yuki.

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:45.700
I went to see roses that only bloom

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:45.700
once in ten years.

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:48.290
But I was told they wouldn't

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:48.290
hold up if I picked them,

00:02:48.370 --> 00:02:49.450
so I didn't bring any back.

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:53.040
But next time,

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:53.040
I'll preserve it in resin.

00:02:53.410 --> 00:02:56.290
Were they pretty, Brother?

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:02.750
How long must you

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:02.750
keep Yuki locked away

00:03:02.830 --> 00:03:04.620
in a basement room

00:03:02.830 --> 00:03:04.620
without any windows?

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:07.370
Kaname...

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:13.500
In recent times, the Senate has

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:13.500
been trying to take advantage

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:15.500
of the Purebloods' existence,

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:15.500
as well as their powers.

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:19.160
We don't want Yuki to

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:19.160
get caught up in that.

00:03:19.950 --> 00:03:22.000
Even though we realize this is cruel.

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:30.870
I'm okay with this. So please

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:30.870
don't look so upset, Brother.

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:38.950
I will always be by your side.

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:52.120
I'm surprised that you were

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:52.120
able to slip through

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:54.620
the Senate's surveillance,

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:54.620
Big Brother.

00:03:55.950 --> 00:03:59.910
I'm here to take

00:03:55.950 --> 00:03:59.910
your precious daughter with me.

00:04:01.620 --> 00:04:05.040
Why you--!!

00:04:01.620 --> 00:04:05.040
You want to take my child again?!

00:04:07.410 --> 00:04:10.120
Don't worry.

00:04:07.410 --> 00:04:10.120
I'm right here with you.

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:12.620
But I can smell so much blood.

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:15.290
I'm sorry you have to be so scared.

00:04:15.790 --> 00:04:19.370
I think these happy times

00:04:15.790 --> 00:04:19.370
made me too euphoric.

00:04:20.450 --> 00:04:22.120
But I've come to a decision.

00:04:22.910 --> 00:04:25.040
I promise to prepare a place...

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:27.290
where you won't

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:27.290
have to be afraid again.

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:31.370
Kaname... Yuki.

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:32.580
Mother!

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:35.500
Mother, where's Father?

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:44.950
I'm sorry.

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:44.950
I should have taken care of Rido.

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:47.950
Thank you.

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:52.790
Please take care of Yuki.

00:04:58.370 --> 00:04:59.750
Yuki, come with me.

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:01.410
What about Brother?

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:04.950
Huh?! Brother!

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:10.660
Brother Kaname!

00:05:15.910 --> 00:05:18.750
I'm going to put all

00:05:15.910 --> 00:05:18.750
your vampire traits to sleep,

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:20.660
and make you a normal human.

00:05:20.950 --> 00:05:25.870
Mother! Where's Brother?!

00:05:20.950 --> 00:05:25.870
There's something scary outside!

00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:32.790
Once this spell is cast,

00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:32.790
I will no longer be able to stay by you.

00:05:33.200 --> 00:05:36.660
But I am happy that I am

00:05:33.200 --> 00:05:36.660
able to do this for you.

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:43.870
I hope you don't hate me

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:43.870
for deciding this for you. But...

00:05:43.950 --> 00:05:46.370
M-Mother...

00:05:47.120 --> 00:05:52.330
The next time you awaken,

00:05:47.120 --> 00:05:52.330
you will...remember...nothing.

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:10.200
<i>Yuki was...</i>

00:06:14.870 --> 00:06:15.870
<i>That girl...</i>

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:18.910
<i>Impossible...</i>

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:33.750
Anymore...and she'll die.

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:37.620
You would show compassion

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:37.620
to a human?

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:41.290
Is that Kaname's idealism?

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:42.830
Yes.

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:50.200
The smell of this blood...

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:55.750
So the fruit I waited

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:55.750
for has finally ripened.

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:58.120
That Kaname went ahead

00:06:58.200 --> 00:07:01.950
and turned her into a vampire

00:06:58.200 --> 00:07:01.950
without any suffering.

00:07:02.200 --> 00:07:04.790
It would have been better for her

00:07:02.200 --> 00:07:04.790
if she had drunk Kuran blood

00:07:04.870 --> 00:07:07.910
while she was still human, and then

00:07:04.870 --> 00:07:07.910
was destroyed upon awakening.

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:18.790
So Yuki Cross was

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:18.790
a Pureblood vampire?

00:07:24.160 --> 00:07:27.450
Don't tell me...she's...

00:07:24.160 --> 00:07:27.450
your younger sister?

00:07:30.370 --> 00:07:33.700
Hanabusa, there was no daughter

00:07:30.370 --> 00:07:33.700
in the Kuran family.

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:38.870
Yuki was the cherished daughter

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:38.870
that Haruka and Juri kept hidden.

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:40.540
And...

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:44.410
She is the girl who was

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:44.410
born to be my bride.

00:07:45.410 --> 00:07:50.870
If Yuki still wishes it...

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:54.450
Why are you so shocked?

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:58.330
Intermarriage between siblings

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:58.330
is not unusual among Purebloods.

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:00.330
Yes...

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:03.700
The person behind all the unrest

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:03.700
that has shrouded this Academy...

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:08.500
is after your younger sister?

00:08:09.830 --> 00:08:11.330
Aren't you going to ask

00:08:09.830 --> 00:08:11.330
who this enemy is?

00:08:13.370 --> 00:08:17.830
Because you are a Pureblood is

00:08:13.370 --> 00:08:17.830
not the only reason we serve you.

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:23.910
I depend on you too much.

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:32.660
<i>That girl is Lord Kaname's...</i>

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:46.330
<i>Yuki is without a doubt</i>

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:46.330
<i>a Pureblood daughter of the Kuran.</i>

00:08:57.120 --> 00:09:01.120
Zero Kiryu...

00:08:57.120 --> 00:09:01.120
Ichiru's twin, huh.

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:07.660
<i>Yuki is...a Pureblood.</i>

00:09:13.580 --> 00:09:17.080
Ichijo, do you know

00:09:13.580 --> 00:09:17.080
the Hunter taboo regarding twins?

00:09:17.580 --> 00:09:19.910
The Hunter...?

00:09:17.580 --> 00:09:19.910
I know its origin.

00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:26.080
Well, they clash so much,

00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:26.080
it may not be relevant.

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:29.580
You seem disturbed.

00:09:30.410 --> 00:09:33.870
Is it because you disapprove

00:09:30.410 --> 00:09:33.870
my sacrificing that girl to resurrect?

00:09:34.290 --> 00:09:36.950
Or is it because

00:09:34.290 --> 00:09:36.950
you betrayed Kaname?

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:42.750
Do you find it unforgivable that

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:42.750
I am holding Senri's body hostage?!

00:09:43.910 --> 00:09:44.910
Please stop!

00:09:48.830 --> 00:09:53.540
Don't hide over there.

00:09:48.830 --> 00:09:53.540
Come on down, Rima.

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:57.580
Say...just who are you?

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:02.660
I'm not going to

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:02.660
let you pass so easily.

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:11.580
<i>My body...feels so hot.</i>

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:16.700
<i>I'm so...thirsty...thirsty!</i>

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:22.160
Yuki...

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:26.330
You don't have to hold back.

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:45.500
Kaname... I...

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:50.080
It's all right.

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:50.080
I know what you want to do.

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:56.000
<i>I want...</i>

00:10:57.000 --> 00:10:58.870
I'm sorry, Yuki.

00:11:00.410 --> 00:11:04.370
I've pulled you back into

00:11:00.410 --> 00:11:04.370
the curse of this repulsive blood!

00:11:05.660 --> 00:11:07.450
<i>...his...</i>

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:11.950
I DESIRE HIS BLOOD

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:28.410
Yes, like that...

00:11:31.450 --> 00:11:32.450
Yuki...

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:35.540
Don't cry.

00:11:36.620 --> 00:11:40.410
I think, perhaps,

00:11:36.620 --> 00:11:40.410
I've longed for this day.

00:11:43.120 --> 00:11:46.200
<i>My body is being immersed</i>

00:11:43.120 --> 00:11:46.200
<i>in this man's blood.</i>

00:11:47.200 --> 00:11:50.370
<i>I can't tell which is me anymore.</i>

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:56.870
<i>What...is this?</i>

00:11:58.700 --> 00:12:00.540
<i>A fragment of his memory?</i>

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:08.410
You saw?

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:14.580
Yes, something very frightening.

00:12:15.450 --> 00:12:21.040
But...I'm not human either, so...

00:12:22.790 --> 00:12:23.790
I remembered.

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:30.040
That night, Mother sacrificed herself

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:30.040
and put a lid inside me.

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:32.040
Father went above ground.

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:34.410
He said he was going to

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:34.410
protect me from someone evil.

00:12:38.790 --> 00:12:41.200
They were both so strong...

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:44.000
Yet, they're no longer here.

00:12:45.540 --> 00:12:51.330
Why? Why did they have to go so far...

00:12:45.540 --> 00:12:51.330
to keep me away from whatever it was?!

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:53.410
No...calm down...

00:13:05.660 --> 00:13:06.660
I...?

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:13.160
Yuki, don't deny your existence.

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:16.750
Don't deny your parent's love for you.

00:13:18.950 --> 00:13:22.330
For ten years...

00:13:18.950 --> 00:13:22.330
I've watched over you in their place.

00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:25.200
You who had forgotten everything.

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:29.500
Kaname...

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:31.750
Brother...

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:36.500
Something's wrong with me.

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:38.700
Why?

00:13:40.830 --> 00:13:44.870
Because all this time,

00:13:40.830 --> 00:13:44.870
I've been in love with my brother.

00:13:48.450 --> 00:13:50.620
What of it?

00:13:55.120 --> 00:14:00.290
But all this time,

00:13:55.120 --> 00:14:00.290
I've lived as a human being.

00:14:01.120 --> 00:14:05.160
So? You and I are betrothed.

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:10.790
<i>We're going to be like</i>

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:10.790
<i>Mother and Father someday.</i>

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:14.450
<i>You and me, Big Brother?</i>

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:18.750
Mother and Father were siblings.

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:22.660
But that...that just seems...

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:25.540
Something only animals would do?

00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:28.200
You're right.

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:30.450
We are not human.

00:14:31.370 --> 00:14:36.040
Or, will you leave,

00:14:31.370 --> 00:14:36.040
making me alone once more?

00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:38.000
Alone...

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:45.450
What is this smell?

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:45.450
Blood? Whose?

00:14:45.910 --> 00:14:51.450
Yes, Yuki...

00:14:45.910 --> 00:14:51.450
Just enjoy the smell of blood.

00:14:52.580 --> 00:14:57.870
By doing so,

00:14:52.580 --> 00:14:57.870
you will know where you truly belong.

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:06.250
Stay here, Yuki.

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:06.250
I will be right back.

00:15:10.790 --> 00:15:11.790
<i>Who?</i>

00:15:13.540 --> 00:15:15.750
<i>This disturbing presence</i>

00:15:13.540 --> 00:15:15.750
<i>and this smell of blood?</i>

00:15:19.120 --> 00:15:20.120
<i>It's not Zero...</i>

00:15:24.910 --> 00:15:25.910
Rima!

00:15:27.950 --> 00:15:31.000
I said I won't let you pass easily!

00:15:46.870 --> 00:15:49.450
How dare you scar a model's face!!

00:15:51.790 --> 00:15:55.910
I'm relieved because

00:15:51.790 --> 00:15:55.910
it's not Zero's blood?

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:05.080
I don't have any right

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:05.080
to worry about that.

00:16:07.370 --> 00:16:10.830
I'm glad that I was born

00:16:07.370 --> 00:16:10.830
a vampire at times like this.

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:13.870
Wounds heal very quickly.

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:19.870
Rima, don't overexert yourself.

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:21.540
Ichijo...

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:23.120
Please stop!

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:26.750
Now is not the time to taint

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:26.750
Shiki's hands in this manner.

00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:32.250
And what if I tell you that I'm going to

00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:32.250
destroy all who defy the Senate anyway,

00:16:32.330 --> 00:16:34.450
in accordance with Ichio's wishes?

00:16:34.870 --> 00:16:35.870
Lord Rido!

00:16:36.450 --> 00:16:37.450
How disgusting!

00:16:38.450 --> 00:16:42.040
You may look and sound like Shiki,

00:16:38.450 --> 00:16:42.040
but don't presume to talk down to me!

00:16:43.620 --> 00:16:46.870
Hey, you in there! I'm going to

00:16:43.620 --> 00:16:46.870
drive you out of Shiki's body!

00:16:46.950 --> 00:16:48.000
Resign yourself!

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:52.040
As if that's so easy.

00:16:54.330 --> 00:16:55.330
Rima!

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:02.870
I missed?

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:05.870
Don't interfere, Ichijo.

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:07.500
Lord Rido!

00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:09.950
Shiki...

00:17:11.790 --> 00:17:15.120
You fool! Letting people

00:17:11.790 --> 00:17:15.120
have their way with you!

00:17:17.580 --> 00:17:21.620
You have to love yourself more!

00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:40.080
Do not defy me...Senri!

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:48.200
Just a little more...

00:17:48.950 --> 00:17:50.950
<i>Hurry! Hurry...</i>

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:53.120
<i>Yuki Cross.</i>

00:17:56.830 --> 00:18:01.450
I am...a Pureblood vampire.

00:18:03.330 --> 00:18:10.080
<i>Yes... You are that which Zero</i>

00:18:03.330 --> 00:18:10.080
<i>absolutely despises...a monster.</i>

00:18:13.370 --> 00:18:16.040
<i>Yes, there's no way</i>

00:18:13.370 --> 00:18:16.040
<i>I can stay near him.</i>

00:18:17.040 --> 00:18:20.450
<i>I've been deceiving him</i>

00:18:17.040 --> 00:18:20.450
<i>all this time.</i>

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:23.950
<i>Furthermore,</i>

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:23.950
<i>I let him drink my blood.</i>

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:26.250
<i>I was so wrong in thinking</i>

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:26.250
<i>I was saving him!</i>

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:28.830
<i>How could I?!</i>

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:30.790
<i>Such a hypocrite!</i>

00:18:33.370 --> 00:18:37.290
<i>Yet...I still...</i>

00:18:39.410 --> 00:18:40.450
want to see Zero.

00:18:41.410 --> 00:18:42.870
<i>And what will you do?</i>

00:18:46.040 --> 00:18:47.040
<i>Talk to him.</i>

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:50.620
<i>What could you</i>

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:50.620
<i>say to him at this point?</i>

00:18:57.950 --> 00:18:59.830
<i>I want to see...Zero!</i>

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:04.120
Hey, Hanabusa.

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:05.370
Hmm?

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:07.200
Looks like she's

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:07.200
going to escape, after all.

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:09.660
Yuki Cross!

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:14.160
I mean, Lady Yuki Kuran...

00:19:15.620 --> 00:19:19.450
Kaname ordered us to

00:19:15.620 --> 00:19:19.450
stay here and protect you.

00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:24.620
Please move away, Aido, Kain.

00:19:25.870 --> 00:19:27.000
We can't do that.

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:30.500
Please return to your room, Yuki--!

00:19:31.750 --> 00:19:32.910
Please move aside!

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:41.200
Both of you...

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:48.120
If you do not want Kaname

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:48.120
to chew you out, you can come with me.

00:19:52.450 --> 00:19:55.120
Seiren, it will soon be daybreak.

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:59.160
Gather those who are able to move

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:59.160
during the day to guard Day Dorm.

00:19:59.620 --> 00:20:02.040
They are not to let

00:19:59.620 --> 00:20:02.040
any Day Class students outside.

00:20:02.330 --> 00:20:04.330
I understand, my master.

00:20:08.950 --> 00:20:09.950
Lord Kaname...

00:20:10.370 --> 00:20:11.370
Ruka...

00:20:12.160 --> 00:20:13.410
I've surmised what is happening

00:20:13.500 --> 00:20:16.370
from the scent of the blood

00:20:13.500 --> 00:20:16.370
and the surroundings.

00:20:17.620 --> 00:20:21.500
Why do you look so apologetic?

00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:28.910
I have been a fool,

00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:28.910
only concerned with my own feelings.

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:31.370
Until I was faced with the truth...

00:20:33.410 --> 00:20:35.120
I will go to the Sun Dormitory too.

00:20:43.120 --> 00:20:44.120
Ruka...

00:20:44.750 --> 00:20:45.750
Forgive me.

00:20:46.330 --> 00:20:49.660
I was just caught up

00:20:46.330 --> 00:20:49.660
in my own dreams...

00:20:50.160 --> 00:20:53.450
So please don't apologize...

00:20:50.160 --> 00:20:53.450
Lord Kaname.

00:20:55.330 --> 00:21:01.950
Then Ruka... I will say something

00:20:55.330 --> 00:21:01.950
that is very unfair to you.

00:21:05.620 --> 00:21:07.120
I trust you.

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:14.330
Thank you very much.

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:20.330
Akatsuki, perfect timing.

00:21:21.830 --> 00:21:25.910
It's almost dawn. But please

00:21:21.830 --> 00:21:25.910
continue to guard the Sun Dormitory.

00:21:26.370 --> 00:21:30.080
There are no Day Classes today.

00:21:26.370 --> 00:21:30.080
No one is to be allowed outside.

00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:31.500
Hey, Ruka...

00:21:32.410 --> 00:21:33.410
Are you all right?

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:42.080
I want to prove that I'm a cool,

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:42.080
reliable woman. Besides...

00:21:45.410 --> 00:21:49.500
I'm not the one who will be facing

00:21:45.410 --> 00:21:49.500
enormous difficulties from now.

00:21:53.410 --> 00:21:58.250
<i>If I still have the strength...</i>

00:21:59.950 --> 00:22:03.450
<i>I thought I had come here</i>

00:21:59.950 --> 00:22:03.450
<i>with my mind made up.</i>

00:22:05.620 --> 00:22:06.620
<i>But...</i>

00:22:08.040 --> 00:22:12.580
<i>It sounds like you're saying</i>

00:22:08.040 --> 00:22:12.580
<i>you really need me.</i>

00:23:59.120 --> 00:24:04.120
Next time:

00:23:59.120 --> 00:24:04.120
"Revival of the Mad Emperor"
